  "details": "Good day, I would like to ask how the verification for 18+ will work.\n\nWill the system of the given state or companies that already provide verification also work?\n\nCan these systems be applied? Because in my country, there is an option for 'MOJE ID' and 'E-ID'.\n\nWould it work as well? My country aims to digitalize everything.\n\nIn my country, there are companies that manage identity verification by checking:\n\na recommendation letter that can only be collected with a citizen ID; otherwise, the letter cannot be received (Code 1),\n\nan SMS sent to a registered phone contract (Code 2),\n\nan email (Code 3).\n\nThis is how I once confirmed my electronic identity.\n\nI have MOJE ID, which has my identity verified. Can this be used here as well?\n\nOr even better, in a few months, my country’s E-ID system should be fully operational. It is already used in government offices, post offices, and other institutions. Could this also be applied, or not?",
